    "text": "By Alex Chavarria ,\n11 hours ago In the heart of Weiser, something meaningful is growing, something built on service, sacrifice, and the unbreakable bond shared by those who have worn the uniform. The Washington County Veterans organization is more than a group, it’s a mission. A mission to honor local heroes, support one another, and ensure that no veteran stands alone. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
